- Added Live2D animation for the last three girls to the game;
- All puzzles are changed to new ones;
- Due to the update of the puzzles, it is necessary to play the game again;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38976327/a8466af49418160f9381b4972a50f50a399909a1.gif[/img]
In anticipation of the announcement of a new game from LOVE SYNERGY, the game "Hentai Chicks 2" has been updated:
- Added 3 new girls and 3 new puzzles to the game;
- One of the past girls has been replaced with a new one;
- All puzzles have been changed to new ones (except for two);
- Due to the update of the puzzles and the addition of new girls, you must complete the game again;
- Minor edits
